## Statements

### If-Then-Else

```redblue
if condition
    // statements
end

if condition
    // then branch
else
    // else branch
end

if x > 0
    say "positive"
else if x < 0
    say "negative"
else
    say "zero"
end
```

### When (Pattern Matching)

```redblue
when value
    case 1 then say "one"
    case 2 then say "two"
    else say "other"
end
```

### Unless

```redblue
unless is_valid
    say "Invalid!"
end
```

### For Loop (Iteration)

```redblue
for each item in items
    say item
end
```

### For Loop (Range)

```redblue
for each i from 1 to 10
    say i
end

// With step
for each i from 0 to 100 by 5
    say i
end

// A negative step counts down
for each i from 5 to 1 by -1
    say i
